        "lastError": "Codex error: {\"type\":\"error\",\"error\":{\"type\":\"server_error\",\"code\":\"server_error\",\"message\":\"An error occurred while processing your request. You can retry your request, or contact us through our help center at help.openai.com if the error persists. Please include the request ID 5f5d96e6-7feb-49f3-9784-70c512b25eb1 in your message.\",\"param\":null},\"sequence_number\":2}"
